# pyenv
#   For a library or app, you might want to share your .python-version.
#   Document details: https://github.com/pyenv/pyenv#local-version-file
#.python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if delegates have different platforms or python versions,
#   this may cause dependency resolution issues.
#Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, poetry.lock contains the exact dependency versions.
#   See https://python-poetry.org/docs/basic-usage/#commit-your-poetrylock-file-to-version-control
#poetry.lock

